msgstr ""
"```markdown\n"
"# rosetta.lang_codes\n"
"\n"
"*   *_Language Codes_*:\n"
"    *   `ROSETTA_LANG_CODE`: A code used to uniquely identify languages.\n"
"    *   `_ROSETTA_LANGCODES`: A set of unique language codes for Rosetta.\n"
"\n"
"    *_Language_*:\n"
"        -   *_ISO 639-2 alpha_*: The ISO 639-2 alpha standard is a two-letter code used to specify the language in English.\n"
"\n"
"    *_List_*:\n"
"        -   `*_ROSETTA_LANGCODES_*`\n"
"```````````````````````````"

