#: ../../source/readme_rosetta.rst:24
msgid "readme_rosetta.markdown_handler module"
msgstr ""
"README\n"
"====================================\n"
"\n"
"rosetta-markdown-handler模块\n"
"\n"
"### 介绍\n"
"这是一个用于处理 Markdown 对象的 rosetta 模式。\n"
"\n"
"### 功能\n"
"*   提供 `MarkdownHandler` 类，用于创建 Markdown 处理器。\n"
"*   支持各种语法规则和配置选项。\n"
"\n"
"### 快速示例\n"
"```python\n"
"from rosetta_markdown_handler import MarkdownHandler\n"
"\n"
"# 创建一个新实例并设置配置选项\n"
"handler = MarkdownHeader()\n"
"\n"
"# 运行 Markdown 代码并获得处理结果\n"
"markdown_code = \"\"\"\n"
"# Header\n"
"## Subheader\n"
"\n"
"This is a paragraph of text.\n"
"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\"\n"
"result = handler.process(markdown_code)\n"
"print(result)\n"
"`````````````\n"
"\n"
"### 配置选项\n"
"*   `header`: 指定是否要处理标题。\n"
"*   `subheader`: 指定是否要处理下级标题。\n"
"*   `paragraphs`: 指定是否要处理段落。\n"
"\n"
"### API 참조\n"
"参见 [MarkdownHandler](rosetta-markdown-handler/Classes#markdownhandler) 类的 API Documentation。"

