"\n"
"Fixed Underlines\n"
"================\n"
"\n"
"These lines are surrounded by `_` characters.\n"
"\n"
"_This line will be displayed normally_\n"
"\n"
"_This line will have an underline_\n"
"\n"
"..."

#: of readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.protect_rst:1
msgid "Replaces rST-specific syntax with placeholders to prevent translation."
msgstr ""
"**_原文中使用的rST特性已被替换为占位符_**\n"
"\n"
"**_请注意，原始内容可能会丢失某些特定功能或格式_**\n"
"\n"
"*   **_用*斜体*表示文本_**\n"
"    *   *example*\n"
"*   **_用+表示标题_**\n"
"    +   +title+\n"
"*   **_用-创建分节_**\n"
"    -   -section-\n"
"*   **_用..创建连接_**\n"
"    .. connect: ...\n"
"*   **_用.. _create link_**\n"
"    .. _link: ..."

#: of readme_rosetta.sphinx_handler.SphinxHandler.protect_rst:4
