"================\n"
"\n"
".. toctree:: ../restored/\n"
"\n"
"RESTORE\n"
"--------\n"
"\n"
"RESTORE 命令用于恢复项目。\n"
"```rst\n"
"$ rustc --release restore.rs\n"
"./restore target/release/restored\n"
"`````````````````````````````````\n"
"使用 ``rustc'' 生成目标程序，需要 ``-C target-cpu`` 和 ``-C linked-libs=sdxxvfa``。"

