#: ../../source/readme_rosetta.rst:48
msgid "readme_rosetta.translator module"
msgstr ""
"README (rosetta)\n"
"\n"
"### rosettaTranslator\n"
"\n"
"#### Translating between languages\n"
"rosettaTranslator是一个翻译工具，提供一个简单的API来进行跨语言的翻译。它支持多种语言。\n"
"rosettaTranslator是一款翻译工具，它为用户提供了一个简单的接口，可以使用API进行跨语言的翻译。它支持多种语言。\n"
"\n"
"#### 使用方式\n"
"1. 创建一个RoSetta translator实例： \n"
"    ```python\n"
"from rosetta_translator import Translator\n"
"translator = Translator('en', 'zh')\n"
"```````````````````````````````````\n"
"2. 使用translate方法进行翻译：\n"
"    ```python\n"
"result = translator.translate('Hello, world!')\n"
"print(result)\n"
"`````````````\n"
"3. 在实例关闭时，需要手动调用clear_memory()来释放内存。\n"
"    ```python\n"
"translator.clear_memory()\n"
"`````````````````````````\n"
"\n"
"#### 提示\n"
"请确保您的RoSetta translator实例是创建完成的，并且在使用前确认翻译的语言对。"

